Electricity price data sourced from the ENTSO-E Transparency Platform
(https://transparency.entsoe.eu/). ENTSO-E does not endorse this project and is
not responsible for its content or for any forecasts derived from the data.

Dataset:   cz-day-ahead-prices.csv
Series:    Day-ahead prices (Transparency Regulation article 12.1.d),
           bidding zone BZN|CZ (10YCZ-CEPS-----N), EUR/MWh
Extract:   delivery day 2018-01-01 through 2024-12-31, Europe/Prague
           (delivery periods 2017-12-31T23:00:00Z through 2024-12-31T22:00:00Z)
Provenance: derived from seven annual GUI_ENERGY_PRICES CSV exports downloaded
           from the Transparency Platform for the diploma thesis this project
           builds on, retrieved into this repository on 2026-09-02.
           No price value was altered; see README.md in this directory.

Re-use is under the Transparency Platform General Terms and Conditions. On a
request from ENTSO-E or from the Primary Owner of Data, this series will be
withdrawn from public display promptly and without argument; see the repository
README for the maintainer contact.

ENTSO-E performs no control on the accuracy, currency or consistency of the data
published on the Transparency Platform, and the Data User uses it under sole
responsibility (General Terms and Conditions, clause 6).
